# Brinelab Tower's spill lab with the suit on (CIPlay brinelab_tower_acidsuit, 11-08; in a test world 'CI ...', under
# CIGapsWatchHealth, no CIGapsSuit): the suit from the box by the annex door, then the acid takes nothing (expect
# unhurt) all the way to the locker and back. brinelab_tower_acid is the run without the suit and the drain lever.
island Brinelab Tower keep
offset 0 0
hour 11
weather Calm
at 43.6 -24
use blspillsuits
expect shown blspill
walk 43.6 -24 to 46.25 -25 to 46.25 -23 to 47 -21 to 48.6 -19.4
wait 6
expect unhurt
open Sample annex locker
wait 2
walk 48.6 -19.4 to 47 -21 to 46.25 -23 to 46.25 -26
expect unhurt
